    {
      "uid": "zhcn:325511ae938ddf07d85f7c3f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她连被认为是签约契机的『选拔赛』都还没参加呢。\r\n不过，倒也没有规定说在那之前不能签约。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2d3880844327574f163be12f27da8bb0d108d4ad079b748a3aa897aa9900ab0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018001.json",
      "json_path": [
