      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eca0b92041e84847e537e1f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对于其他的训练员来说，\r\n气槽大概也是十分特别的存在吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ab5934ebea01dc59a41116dea6ffc82418355b027afb85c55023649b4cd5d66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56aef6432e1f89a761c15a5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那天，我抱着遗憾的心情，离开了跑道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e81bf668b4798bca8e73f937edd061e3502c122bfd6f78415e86168d6a97d95b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018001.json",
      "json_path": [
