    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:486b5d666e218b78a83ba824",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "859051e831aa125febaf30affc00b2a41c40ac4b8d2ac6c3e681bad9b0d37a18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:543cedb8cdb752ad238e7869",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……待我缓过神来，已经过去了好一段时间。\r\n不知何时，天空已被染成了暗红色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b1d89490bcdb1afae27ffb739e4d02d9908fa0a317fba53eb51ae44e877eeb4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc9e25a4d26b21aaeb56bfbe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这时，有一名马娘朝着\r\n训练告一段落的气槽身边走来――",
      "source_fingerprint": "03bba0f96e946ef221057de61edc56f25bd14f686197dd461e97dd4e365bb777",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e71739cc9fc394b0f449329a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb75d8172527b3c333e07414fc28cbbd82f876b513cb7854a257f05f5e6b2ba3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a18009cbf8053ee7f8e750f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽！　抱歉让你久等了。\r\n我在外面跑步的时候，有点忘我了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d0ee236226df2ea95af0565382c99ea270d586fed3cf0db0f2d836018bb560f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:852871bc0d4ad351fe00af91",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018001.json",
      "json_path": [
