      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b66180365848f021cbcf9d15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哼……你还是老样子呢，铃鹿。\r\n不过没关系，我早就知道会是这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0b5abd71445961440264d91fb6cd7788b4e82a1df452e1f18337c08ba2c148c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0396945e290cb32b520cb57",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "理想中的“女帝”",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d5be25dceaf5c5e5c849e1b00d0e508bafffa7bc438f1f9f63d2f513958e2fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e1a4a6d6613c9bd5a43c79e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与气槽的相遇令我印象深刻。那之后第二天。\r\n我在走廊里听到了争吵声，就去看了看――",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e214022b7053689d6fc0e6a113ce7068e5245a0cd49cc801578263d6d7f0d19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12e4086dda543f4b729bf9b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽的签约训练员",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0ee740a2c3bb111ea9942d36b39dd2e9bd6eb9eac3c8e1213877d862e742e20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa265c848be4022c7f614f02",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为、为什么呢？　我是气槽的训练员哦！\r\n既然如此也该听听我的吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "516b273e47d60096eeb0bbf9307991426a82c53e88aa929bb633ebbbcc2a2ffa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc5c2a5b3c840de12da7205f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba58fa29016f4366679b31c483127417c7d74c51f8dbea2e0de6e4b65088d5e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eea257be0402d0d4680c8d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是吗？　那么，我就告辞了。\r\n不过……不要太过严苛了哦，气槽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "657719f54b7ab2e485857eb30acb36efbbae0b7e8afdcc54a81ea37c31b5932f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8412d9bd1d8c02532241c48b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
