      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "竟敢说，『无谓的』……　既然你做出这样的发言，\r\n那我们就没有进一步对话的余地了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fde609beb297a207b04df2664b82bae558fe145185c55a90079ce969e7e96a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
