      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中取得成绩……如果你只是盯着这一点的话，\r\n那只能说，我跟你看待事情的视角不一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45c708102aed6b66eec8fe0336ac5fab4c0dcc7ababd861e4cbf43d3d9b7394a",
