    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7749a497c4fd411e9180011",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，就这样一直去参与学生会活动和指导后辈的话，\r\n会妨碍到她自身的成长的！　所以说――",
      "source_fingerprint": "150a2018c01856882b6ffad4d151912ebb9b64b16df5ca25fa565fe3fb411671",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
