      "uid": "zhcn:3bb6224014717bc976656936",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了能够得到气槽的认可，\r\n我花了整整一晚上去拼命研究训练项目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8265c06f46b23ac09942963b49ef46435a2049dbced42cf32cae783095fe4ad1",
